+#: src/concepts/codecs.md:108
+msgid ""
+"`--max-rdf-bytes` bounds raw RDF acquisition, separately from parser and "
+"native decode storage. The exported root binds the source IRI, profile "
+"identity (including its bounds) and SHA-256 digest of the original source "
+"bytes. Equal bytes under a different source IRI or profile need not have the "
