+#: src/concepts/jsonld.md:419
+msgid ""
+"The CLI permits at most one stdin reader across request, source and frame, "
+"and applies the existing path/global-option protections. C exposes "
+"`purrdf_document_frame(source, source_len, frame, frame_len, request_json, "
+"request_len, out_buffer, out_error)`. All three borrowed pointer/length "
